config.code:
return input.body
  .filter(i => !i.pull_request)
  .map(i => ({ number: i.number, title: i.title, labels: i.labels.map(l => l.name), comments: i.comments, updated: i.updated_at }));

config.prompt:
Here are the open issues for {{ vars.repo }} as JSON:
{{ JSON.stringify(input) }}

Group them by theme, call out anything that looks urgent (bug labels, many comments, stale for over 2 weeks), and suggest the top 3 to tackle today.
